  "designNotes": "Ore enters low on the left but wire must leave through the top edge, and the press turns its output a quarter turn from its input, so a straight line cannot work: the smelter and press need different rotations and a hand-off belt that turns. The reference stacks smelter and press near the middle; the alternates curl the chain into a smaller box (footprint 20) at the price of a few more belts and ticks of latency.",
